# Local development needs no settings: npm run dev (Local, 5600 -> API 4600) / npm run dev:live (5700 -> 4700).
# Backend address for the dev/preview proxy — set in the shell, not in this file:
#   VITE_API_PROXY=http://localhost:4600
# Vercel: no env needed. vercel.json forwards /api/* to the Render backend (edit the URL there).
# Only if the API is called directly on another domain instead of through /api:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
